# Subtest: the Terms, the Privacy Policy and the website say 18 and older, and nothing younger
not ok 69 - the Terms, the Privacy Policy and the website say 18 and older, and nothing younger
  ---
  duration_ms: 3.05807
  type: 'test'
  location: '/home/user/story-trail/verification/minimum-age.cjs:29:1'
  failureType: 'testCodeFailure'
  error: |-
    The input did not match the regular expression /## 9\. Katkee is for adults \(18 and older\)\n\nKatkee is only for people 18 and older\./. Input:
    
    '# Katkee Privacy Policy\n' +
      '\n' +
      '**Last updated:** 19 October 2026\n' +
      '\n' +
      'This policy explains what Katkee collects, how we use it, who can see it, how long we keep it\n' +
      'and the choices you have. It covers the Katkee apps for iPhone and Android, the website at\n' +
      'katkee.com and the service behind them.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '## 1. Who we are\n' +
      '\n' +
      'Katkee is operated by Rahul Katakdhond, a sole proprietorship registered in India ("Katkee",\n' +
      '"we", "us"). We decide how and why your personal data is used for the Katkee apps, the website\n' +
      "at katkee.com and the service they use, which makes us the Data Fiduciary under India's Digital\n" +
      'Personal Data Protection Act 2023, and the controller under the EU and UK General Data Protection\n' +
      'Regulation (GDPR) and similar laws elsewhere. Katkee is available worldwide; section 8 explains the\n' +
      'rights you have wherever you live.\n' +
      '\n' +
      'Katkee is only for people 18 and older (section 9).\n' +
      '\n' +
      'Questions about this policy or your data go to privacy@katkee.com. Section 11 has our other\n' +
      'contacts.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '## 2. What we collect\n' +
      '\n' +
      '### Account information\n' +
      'Username, email address, a securely hashed password (we never store your\n' +
      'actual password; see Section 6), display name, **date of birth**, and an\n' +
      'optional bio, interests (up to five) and profile photo.\n' +
      '\n' +
      'If you sign in with your phone number, Twilio receives it to send you a\n' +
      'code. We keep only a keyed fingerprint of the number, not the number\n' +
      'itself, so we can recognise it when you sign in again. If you sign in with\n' +
      'Google, we keep your Google account ID and email address.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '### Date of birth\n' +
      'We ask for your date of birth when you create an account, only to confirm\n' +
      "you're 18 or older (section 9). It's never shown on your profile or to\n" +
      "anyone else, never used for ads, and can't be changed in the app. If you\n" +
      'entered it wrongly, write to privacy@katkee.com to correct it.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '### Content you create\n' +
      'Photos and videos you publish as Stories (with any sound they contain),\n' +
      'captions, stickers and drawings, Highlights you keep, comments, likes,\n' +
      'shares, and the direct messages you send (including photos and videos, and\n' +
      'Stories you share into a conversation). A photo or video you send in a message\n' +
      'can be opened only by you and the person you sent it to.\n' +
      '\n' +
      "If you add a song to a Story, we record which song from Katkee's music\n" +
      'library and which part of it plays. The songs are openly licensed and credited\n' +
      'on the Story; choosing one tells us nothing else about you.\n' +
      '\n' +
      'When you change your profile photo, the app cuts out the square you choose\n' +
      'on your phone and uploads only that square.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '### Your connections\n' +
      "Who you follow, who follows you, follow requests, and who you've blocked or\n" +
      'muted.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '### Your approximate area (Nearby Stories, optional)\n' +
      'Only if you turn on **Nearby Stories**. The app reads an approximate\n' +
      'location once in a while, turns it into a city-sized area (about\n' +
      '39 x 20 km) on your phone, and sends only that area, never your\n' +
      "coordinates. Your phone's **time zone** is also sent, so new Stories can\n" +
      'come from your region even if Nearby Stories is off.\n' +
      '\n' +
      'We use the area and time zone only to show you Stories from people near\n' +
      'you and to show your public Stories to people near you. They are never\n' +
      'shown to anyone, never used for ads, and deleted:\n' +
      '- after 30 days without a refresh;\n' +
      '- at once when you turn Nearby Stories off (the area) or delete your\n' +
      '  account (both).\n' +
      '\n' +
      'If you add a location sticker to a Story, the approximate place you choose\n' +
      'is shown on that Story.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '### Activity used to rank Home and Story reach\n' +
      'We record views, how much of a Story was watched, likes, comments, shares,\n' +
      'profile visits, follows, quick skips, and "Not interested". We use them, and\n' +
      "the interests you chose on your profile (people you don't follow who share\n" +
      'your interests appear higher on your Home), for three things:\n' +
      '- to order your Home;\n' +
      "- to decide how far a public Story reaches beyond its owner's followers;\n" +
      '- to give creators aggregate Insights.\n' +
      '\n' +
      "A Story's view count is public. Only the Story's owner can see who viewed it.\n" +
      '\n' +
      '### Sponsored Stories\n' +
      'Katkee shows Sponsored Stories, labelled "Sponsored", from advertisers. Which\n' +
      "ones you see depends on your interests and your phone's platform (iPhone or\n" +
      'Android). Advertisers receive only totals, such as how many times an ad was\n' +
      'shown or tapped, never who you are. Your messages, area, time zone and date\n' +
      "of birth are never used for ads. We don't use advertising identifiers or track you\n" +
      "across other companies' apps and websites.\n" +
      '\n' +
      '### App usage and crashes\n' +
      "Katkee's own analytics record when the app is opened, which platform and\n" +
      'app version you use, and crash counts. We use them to measure how many\n' +
      "people use Katkee each day and month, and how stable it is. We don't use\n" +
      'third-party analytics or advertising SDKs.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '### Reports\n' +
      'If you report a Story, comment, message or account, we keep a record of the\n' +
      'report, what it was about, and how a moderator resolved it. A reported\n' +
      'message is kept as evidence for the moderator.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '### Technical information\n' +
      '- Your IP address: to limit abuse and secure accounts. It also appears in\n' +
      '  server logs, which Indian law requires us to keep for 180 days (Katkee is\n' +
      '  run from India; see section 5).\n' +
      '- Device and app details for each signed-in session, so you can sign out a\n' +
      '  device.\n' +
      '- The push token Apple or Google gives your phone, so we can send\n' +
      '  notifications.\n' +
      '- When you visit katkee.com, our servers log your IP address and the page\n' +
      '  you asked for, as any website does. The website sets no cookies and has\n' +
      '  no analytics or advertising trackers.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '### What we do **not** collect or do\n' +
      "- We don't access your contacts or your precise location.\n" +
      '- We remove location details (EXIF/GPS and similar metadata) from the copies\n' +
      '  of your photos and videos that we show, and delete uploaded originals 30\n' +
      '  days after processing.\n' +
      "- We don't sell your data, use your content to train third-party AI models,\n" +
      '  or share it with data brokers.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '## 3. How we use it\n' +
      '\n' +
      '- **To operate Katkee**: your account, Stories and Highlights,\n' +
      '  notifications, direct messages, search and suggestions.\n' +
      '- **To rank and reach**: Home and how far public Stories reach, as\n' +
      '  described above.\n' +
      '- **To keep Katkee safe**: rate limits, link checks, and acting on reports.\n' +
      '  A moderator can remove content or restrict, suspend or disable an\n' +
      '  account, and a suspended account is signed out everywhere.\n' +
      '- **For Sponsored Stories and analytics**, as described above.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '## 4. Who can see what\n' +
      '\n' +
      "- **Stories**: a public account's Stories can be seen by anyone, and reach\n" +
      "  people beyond its followers as described above. A private account's\n" +
      '  Stories are seen only by followers it approved. Followers-only Stories\n' +
      '  are seen only by followers.\n' +
      '- **Direct messages**: only the people in the conversation see them. Staff\n' +
      "  can't browse messages. A moderator sees a message only when someone\n" +
      '  reports it.\n' +
      '- **Blocking**: hides your content from someone and theirs from you, both\n' +
      '  ways, at once.\n' +
      '- **Your area and time zone**: never shown to anyone.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '## 5. Service providers\n' +
      '\n' +
      '- **Amazon Web Services**: our servers, database, file storage and email.\n' +
      '- **Google Firebase Cloud Messaging** and **Apple Push Notification\n' +
      '  service**: deliver notifications.\n' +
      '- **Twilio**: sends phone sign-in codes, if you use phone sign-in.\n' +
      '- **Google**: Google sign-in, if you use it, and Safe Browsing checks of\n' +
      '  links posted in Katkee.\n' +
      '\n' +
      'They process data only to provide these services to us. Our servers,\n' +
      'database and files are in India (Amazon Web Services, Mumbai); Twilio,\n' +
      'Google and Apple may process the data they handle for us outside India.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '**Wherever you use Katkee from, your data is stored and processed in India.**\n' +
      'If you live in the European Economic Area, the UK or Switzerland, you give it\n' +
      'to us directly when you use Katkee, and India is not a country the European\n' +
      'Commission or the UK has found to give adequate protection. We protect it as\n' +
      'this policy describes wherever it is, and where a service provider moves it\n' +
      "on, we rely on that provider's Standard Contractual Clauses (or the UK\n" +
      'Addendum) or other safeguards the law recognises. Ask privacy@katkee.com for\n' +
      'a copy of them.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '## 6. How we protect it\n' +
      '\n' +
      "Passwords are hashed with scrypt; we can't recover your actual password.\n" +
      'Sessions use short-lived signed access tokens and an individually revocable\n' +
      'refresh token per device. Connections are encrypted (HTTPS/TLS), and our\n' +
      'database and file storage are encrypted at rest. Staff access to the admin\n' +
      'console needs two-factor authentication, and every admin action is\n' +
      "recorded in an audit log that can't be edited.\n" +
      '\n' +
      '## 7. How long we keep it\n' +
      '\n' +
      '- **Stories**: disappear from view after 24 hours. Highlights you keep\n' +
      '  stay until you remove them.\n' +
      '- **Deleted Stories**: their media is purged after 30 days, unless an open\n' +
      '  report still needs it.\n' +
      '- **Deleted accounts**:\n' +
      '  - unavailable at once;\n' +
      '  - personal data purged and the account scrubbed after 30 days;\n' +
      '  - content removed by moderation kept up to 180 days as evidence;\n' +
      '  - the details you registered with (username and any earlier usernames,\n' +
      '    email address, display name, date of birth and sign-in identifiers)\n' +
      "    kept separately for 180 days after deletion, because India's IT Rules\n" +
      '    2021 (rule 3(1)(h)) require it, then deleted. We use them only to\n' +
      '    answer lawful requests.\n' +
      '- **Uploads never used**: deleted after 48 hours.\n' +
